OL,3,GNEWSAAdder project set back years after
OL,4,Awildfire damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pioneering project to boost a
OL,7,Fcommon's adder population has been set
OL,8,Fback several years after a wildfire
OL,9,Flast month.
OL,11,FThe Berkshire, Buckinghamshire and
OL,12,FOxfordshire Wildlife Trust has set up a
OL,13,Ffundraising campaign after Crookham
OL,14,FCommon in Berkshire was damaged in the
OL,15,Fblaze that started on 14 August and was
OL,16,Ftackled overnight.
OL,18,FIt destroyed approximately two hectares
OL,19,F(4.9 acres) of sensitive scrubland and
OL,20,Fbracken at the designated site of
OL,21,Fspecial scientific interest.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,333,330,200,160,0,100
