OL,3,GNEWSAAdder project set back years after
OL,4,Awildfire damage
OL,5,
OL,6,F"[Firefighters'] professionalism, speed
OL,7,Fand dedication ensured the fire was
OL,8,Fcontained and helped to avert a far
OL,9,Fworse situation," said Kate Titford,
OL,10,Fthe trust's head of communications.
